      "body": "网站：https://image-to-image-jp.com\n\n\nImage to Image is an AI image generation and editing service that allows you to create new images based on an original image. Simply upload an image and describe what you want to change or create. The service uses the original image as a reference, helping you create new visuals while preserving important elements of the source image.\n\nKey Features\n\nImage to Image supports a wide range of image generation and editing tasks. You can transform photos and illustrations into different styles, such as manga or illustration styles, change the overall mood and design, modify backgrounds, and adjust the appearance of people or products. It also supports 1K, 2K, and 4K output resolutions, allowing you to choose the image quality that best fits your needs.\n\nBenefits of Image to Image\n\nThe main advantage of Image to Image is that it generates new images based on an existing image rather than relying only on text prompts. This makes it easier to preserve important elements such as the appearance of people, product details, and composition while applying creative changes. The simple workflow also eliminates the need for complicated image editing software. Just upload an image, enter your instructions, and let AI handle the editing and generation process.\n",
